**/.playwright/

# Temporary files
**/tmp-*.mjs
ext-sideload-test.mjs
# script/oracle-compare.mjs が self-test の入出力 PNG を書き出す先
.tmp-oracle/
# compare-design-runner-system-ui.test.ts が cwd に作るフィクスチャ置き場
**/tmp-system-ui-mask-test/
# verification/script/live-noise-calibration.mjs が書き出す生成物。
# ソースは fixture.html / fixture-defect.html の2枚のみで、他は実行のたびに
# 再生成できる。ハッシュは verification/receipt/live-noise-calibration-2026-07-28.md
# と script/oracle-threshold.mjs のコメントに記録済み。
verification/fixture/live-noise-calibration/*.png
verification/fixture/live-noise-calibration/calibration-report.json

# Debug
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
error.log

# Claude Code local files
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/mcp.json
.claude/memory/

# Verification artifacts (evidence, traces, secrets-masked logs)
# Keep committed: fixture/, script/, correlation/ reports (.png, .md, .json)
# Ignore: per-attempt runs and ad-hoc evidence drops
verification/attempts/
verification/evidence/
verification/traces/
verification/logs/

# Manifests filled with a real Figma file key. The tracked manifests under
# verification/fixture/ carry placeholder keys only; copy one here and fill it in.
verification/fixture/local/

# Evidence build/lint/test logs (not source-of-truth, regeneratable)
docs/evidence/*.log

# Local runtime noise
error.log
.codex
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# Serena tool auto-generated config (differs per machine/session)
.serena/project.yml
.serena/memories/
# Added by code-review-graph
.code-review-graph/
